  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7503.03 Restoration: Possession of Drugs. Prior to such restoration, the hearings examiner shall make further inquiry into the person's fitness to drive if they have evidence that such person has a drug abuse problem which might affect their ability to drive a motor vehicle safely.\n\nSource. #3170, eff 12-31-85; #4451, eff 6-24-88; ss by #4844, eff 6-20-90; ss by #6249, INTERIM, eff 6-16-96, EXPIRES: 10-14-96; ss and moved by #6337, eff 9-25-96 (from Saf-C 204.03); ss by #8174, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRES: 3-24-05; ss by #8230-B, eff 12-17-04; ss by #10395-B, eff 8-15-13; (formerly Saf-C 220.03) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 200); ss by #13938, eff 4-24-24 (formerly Saf-C 205.03) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 7500)",
